  "prefLabel": "Mid 103.06 Notice of Meetings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mid 103.06 Notice of Meetings.\n\n(a) Notice of the time and place of council meetings, excluding emergency meetings, shall be given in accordance with RSA 91-A:2, II.\n\n(b) Information about the time and place of council meetings shall also be available by telephone at the number stated in Mid 104.01 (b).\n\nSource. #7412, eff 12-5-00",
